{"5058110": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Boiled Bison", "steam_appid": 5058110, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5094060], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Boiled Bison is a Singleplayer Psychological Horror experience that pays homage to 1970's slasher films and classic 6th gen horror games alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5058110/extras/7be35a8969366e413f236d9f27c1243b.avif?t=1787594514\" alt=\"Story\" width=495 height=95 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Looking for the next big story to report on after losing his job as a news anchor, jaded journalist Frankie Loza finds himself driving down a lonely road in the middle of Rural New Mexico, where he comes across a lonely shack on the side of the road advertising <strong>&quot;Yummy Buffalo Jerky&quot;</strong>. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Desperate to find anything to get his job back, Frankie goes to investigate this ominous shack, only to be pulled into a gruesome mystery when he wakes up in <strong>an abandoned bison meat processing plant</strong>...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5058110/extras/5cfb4fc3f4d9d9520a2f949980933d75.poster.avif?t=1787594514\" aria-label=\"A cinematic shot of a dark desert night, where a car drives down a dusty highway with a big Bison sign in the foreground\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5058110/extras/5cfb4fc3f4d9d9520a2f949980933d75.webm?t=1787594514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5058110/extras/5cfb4fc3f4d9d9520a2f949980933d75.mp4?t=1787594514\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5058110/extras/1941e35767aea03183b05ae7a0049acb.avif?t=1787594514\" alt=\"Features\" width=495 height=95 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A Third Person Psychological Horror Experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Retro pixelation and lower poly aesthetics akin to 6th gen consoles such as the PS2/Dreamcast</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Limited combat, with an emphasis on puzzle solving and exploration within a twisted, industrial environment</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5058110/extras/3fa9373d3e6dc39b475e84a9c540a985.poster.avif?t=1787594514\" aria-label=\"Gameplay footage of the player approaches a Keypad puzzle, where a random code is inputted\" width=1170 height=500 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5058110/extras/3fa9373d3e6dc39b475e84a9c540a985.webm?t=1787594514\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5058110/extras/3fa9373d3e6dc39b475e84a9c540a985.mp4?t=1787594514\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A linear storyline with multiple endings to discover</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gruesome and visceral scenes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect records of the past and experience the deep inner workings of the Sterlington Meat Company.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" aut